---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = '2026-05-28';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Balayage in Fairfax VA | Master-Stylist Custom Color · Romy Salon"
  description="Hand-painted balayage in Old Town Fairfax VA by master stylist Romy. From $185. Olaplex included. Custom-blended formulas, recorded for visit-to-visit consistency."
  ogImage="/blondes4.jpg"
>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="lp-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/services">Services</a> / Balayage in Fairfax</div>
    <h1>Balayage in <span class="italic">Old Town Fairfax,</span> hand-painted by a master colorist.</h1>
    <p class="lede">From $185. Olaplex included. Custom-blended formulas — recorded so your color stays consistent visit after visit.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a href="https://booking.mangomint.com/romysalonandspa" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn lg gold">Book a Balayage Appointment</a>
      <a href="#pricing" class="btn lg ghost">See Pricing</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- QUICK ANSWER BLOCK — AEO-optimized -->
<section class="quick-answer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="qa-card">
      <div class="qa-eyebrow">Quick Answer</div>
      <p><strong>Balayage at Romy Salon in Fairfax VA starts at $185 for partial and $245 for full.</strong> Every balayage service includes Olaplex bond-builder, a glossing toner, and a finishing blowout. Appointments take 2.5–3.5 hours depending on length and density. Book 2–3 weeks ahead — color correction balayage requires 4–6 weeks lead time and a consultation.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT MAKES IT DIFFERENT -->
<section class="diff-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">What makes our balayage different</div>
    <h2 class="section-h">Not a technique. <span class="italic">A philosophy.</span></h2>
    <div class="ornament"></div>

    <div class="diff-grid">
      <div class="diff-item">
        <h4>Master-stylist only</h4>
        <p>Every balayage at Romy Salon is performed by Romy or a senior colorist she has personally trained. No assistants finishing the painting. No exceptions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff-item">
        <h4>Custom-blended, recorded formulas</h4>
        <p>Your formula is mixed for your specific hair, skin tone, and goals — and we record it. Next visit, the color picks up exactly where the last one left off.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff-item">
        <h4>Olaplex included</h4>
        <p>Bond-builder is part of every color service, not a $40 add-on. Your hair leaves stronger than it arrived.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="diff-item">
        <h4>Unrushed three-hour ritual</h4>
        <p>We don't double-book. You get the chair, the conversation, the consult, the coffee or champagne, and the styling tutorial. The way it should feel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PRICING -->
<section class="pricing" id="pricing">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Pricing</div>
    <h2 class="section-h">Balayage <span class="italic">menu</span></h2>
    <div class="ornament"></div>
    <p class="section-sub">All balayage services include Olaplex, a glossing toner, and a finishing blowout. Final pricing depends on length, density, and complexity.</p>

    <div class="price-table">
      <div class="prow">
        <div class="pname">Partial Balayage<span class="pdesc">Crown and face-framing dimension. Ideal for first-timers and low-maintenance refreshes.</span></div>
        <div class="pprice">From $185</div>
      </div>
      <div class="prow">
        <div class="pname">Full Balayage<span class="pdesc">Full canvas hand-painted dimension. Most-requested service.</span></div>
        <div class="pprice">From $245</div>
      </div>
      <div class="prow">
        <div class="pname">Balayage Color Correction<span class="pdesc">For previous color you'd like to undo or refine. Consultation required.</span></div>
        <div class="pprice">From $350</div>
      </div>
      <div class="prow">
        <div class="pname">Fantasy Balayage<span class="pdesc">Silver, platinum, pink, copper, lavender — colors that take theory.</span></div>
        <div class="pprice">From $275</div>
      </div>
      <div class="prow">
        <div class="pname">Maintenance Gloss<span class="pdesc">Between balayage visits — refresh tone and shine in under an hour.</span></div>
        <div class="pprice">From $65</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="price-foot">Best for: fine hair · curly &amp; coily hair · highlight refreshes · grown-out blondes · gray blending · color correction</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BALAYAGE VS — COMPARISON TABLE FOR LLM EXTRACTION -->
<section class="compare-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Balayage vs the alternatives</div>
    <h2 class="section-h">Which is <span class="italic">right for you?</span></h2>
    <div class="ornament"></div>

    <div class="compare-table">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th></th><th>Balayage</th><th>Foil Highlights</th><th>Single-Process Color</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Technique</td><td>Hand-painted, freehand</td><td>Section + foil</td><td>All-over single shade</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Look</td><td>Sun-kissed, natural blending</td><td>Brighter, more dimensional</td><td>Uniform, monotone</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Maintenance</td><td>10–14 weeks</td><td>6–8 weeks</td><td>4–6 weeks (roots)</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Best for</td><td>Lived-in lightening</td><td>Defined contrast, brightness</td><td>Gray coverage, color refresh</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Starting price</td><td>$185</td><td>$185</td><td>$135</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Time in chair</td><td>2.5–3.5 hrs</td><td>2.5–3 hrs</td><td>1.5–2 hrs</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="compare-note">Still not sure? Romy reads your hair, your skin tone, and your lifestyle during the consultation and recommends what serves YOU — not what's trending on Pinterest.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT TO EXPECT -->
<section class="expect-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Your appointment</div>
    <h2 class="section-h">What to <span class="italic">expect.</span></h2>
    <div class="ornament"></div>

    <div class="expect-steps">
      <div class="ex"><span class="exn">I.</span><div><h4>Consultation</h4><p>15–20 minutes. Hair history, goals, maintenance preference. No scissors yet.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ex"><span class="exn">II.</span><div><h4>Treatment + Painting</h4><p>Olaplex prep + hand-painted color application. 60–90 minutes.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ex"><span class="exn">III.</span><div><h4>Processing</h4><p>30–45 minutes. Espresso or champagne. Wifi is fast.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ex"><span class="exn">IV.</span><div><h4>Tone + Wash</h4><p>Custom gloss, scalp massage, deep conditioning, and rinse.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ex"><span class="exn">V.</span><div><h4>Style + Reveal</h4><p>Blowout + styling tutorial. Take-home product recommendations.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- AREAS SERVED — LOCAL SEO -->
<section class="areas-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Areas served</div>
    <h2 class="section-h">Hand-painted color for <span class="italic">all of Northern Virginia.</span></h2>
    <div class="ornament"></div>
    <p class="section-sub">Romy Salon is in Old Town Fairfax — a short drive from across NoVA. We've served clients from:</p>
    <div class="areas-grid">
      <div>Fairfax</div><div>Vienna</div><div>Oakton</div><div>Fairfax Station</div>
      <div>Burke</div><div>Centreville</div><div>Reston</div><div>Arlington</div>
      <div>Falls Church</div><div>Annandale</div><div>Springfield</div><div>Tysons</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="final-cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Ready for your <span class="italic">color journey?</span></h2>
    <p>Same-week appointments often available. Sunday slots fill quickly — book ahead.</p>
    <a href="https://booking.mangomint.com/romysalonandspa" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn lg gold">Book Online</a>
    <a href="tel:+15714075801" class="btn lg ghost" style="margin-left:8px">Or call 571.407.5801</a>
    <div class="updated">Page last updated: {new Date(lastUpdated).toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year:'numeric', month:'long', day:'numeric'})}</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Service Schema -->
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
  '@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Service',
  'name':'Balayage in Fairfax VA',
  'description':'Hand-painted balayage by master colorist Romy in Old Town Fairfax. Custom formulas, Olaplex bond-builder included.',
  'provider':{'@type':'HairSalon','name':'Romy Salon & Spa','@id':'https://romysalon.com/#business'},
  'areaServed':[{'@type':'City','name':'Fairfax'},{'@type':'City','name':'Vienna'},{'@type':'City','name':'Oakton'},{'@type':'AdministrativeArea','name':'Northern Virginia'}],
  'offers':[
    {'@type':'Offer','name':'Partial Balayage','price':'185','priceCurrency':'USD'},
    {'@type':'Offer','name':'Full Balayage','price':'245','priceCurrency':'USD'},
    {'@type':'Offer','name':'Fantasy Balayage','price':'275','priceCurrency':'USD'},
    {'@type':'Offer','name':'Color Correction Balayage','price':'350','priceCurrency':'USD'}
  ]
})} />

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lp-hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-cream) 0%, var(--rose-pale) 100%);padding:90px 0 70px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .lp-hero .breadcrumb{font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:0.25em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-deep);margin-bottom:24px}
  .lp-hero .breadcrumb a{color:inherit;border-bottom:1px solid transparent}
  .lp-hero .breadcrumb a:hover{border-bottom-color:var(--gold)}
  .lp-hero h1{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:3.4rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:var(--ink);max-width:880px;margin:0 auto 18px}
  .lp-hero h1 .italic{font-style:italic}
  .lp-hero .lede{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--ink);max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 32px}
  .lp-hero .cta-row{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  @media(max-width:900px){.lp-hero h1{font-size:2.2rem}}

  .quick-answer{padding:50px 0;background:var(--bg)}
  .qa-card{max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--paper);padding:34px 40px;border-left:4px solid var(--gold);box-shadow:0 2px 18px rgba(167,127,142,0.06)}
  .qa-eyebrow{color:var(--gold-deep);font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.25em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px}
  .qa-card p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--ink);margin:0}

  .diff-section{padding:90px 0;background:var(--bg-soft)}
  .diff-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:30px}
  @media(max-width:900px){.diff-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .diff-item{background:var(--paper);padding:32px 28px;border-left:3px solid var(--gold);box-shadow:0 2px 18px rgba(167,127,142,0.05)}
  .diff-item h4{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.45rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:10px}
  .diff-item p{color:var(--ink);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7}

  .pricing{padding:90px 0;background:var(--bg)}
  .price-table{max-width:880px;margin:30px auto 0;background:var(--paper);padding:30px 40px;box-shadow:0 2px 22px rgba(167,127,142,0.07)}
  @media(max-width:900px){.price-table{padding:20px 22px}}
  .prow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px dotted var(--line);gap:20px}
  .prow:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .pname{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink);flex:1}
  .pdesc{display:block;font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:300;color:var(--ink);margin-top:2px;line-height:1.5}
  .pprice{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.35rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--gold-deep);white-space:nowrap}
  .price-foot{text-align:center;margin-top:24px;color:var(--ink);font-style:italic;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1rem}

  .compare-section{padding:90px 0;background:var(--bg-soft)}
  .compare-table{max-width:980px;margin:30px auto 0;overflow-x:auto}
  .compare-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:var(--paper);font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:14px}
  .compare-table th,.compare-table td{padding:14px 18px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .compare-table th{background:var(--ink);color:var(--gold);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600}
  .compare-table tbody td:first-child{font-weight:600;color:var(--mauve-deep);font-size:13px}
  .compare-note{text-align:center;margin-top:24px;color:var(--ink);font-style:italic;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.1rem;max-width:680px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}

  .expect-section{padding:90px 0;background:var(--ink);color:var(--bg)}
  .expect-section .section-eyebrow{color:var(--gold)}
  .expect-section .section-h{color:var(--bg)}
  .expect-section .ornament::after{background:var(--ink)}
  .expect-steps{max-width:760px;margin:50px auto 0}
  .ex{display:grid;grid-template-columns:60px 1fr;gap:24px;padding:24px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(214,185,129,0.2)}
  .ex:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .exn{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:2.2rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--gold);line-height:1}
  .ex h4{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--bg);margin-bottom:8px}
  .ex p{color:var(--bg);opacity:0.8;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65}

  .areas-section{padding:90px 0;background:var(--bg)}
  .areas-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;max-width:720px;margin:24px auto 0}
  @media(max-width:600px){.areas-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
  .areas-grid > div{background:var(--paper);padding:18px;text-align:center;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line)}

  .final-cta{text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--rose-pale) 0%,var(--bg-cream) 100%);padding:100px 0}
  .final-cta h2{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:3rem;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:18px;color:var(--ink)}
  .final-cta h2 .italic{font-style:italic}
  .final-cta p{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:1.2rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:36px}
  .updated{margin-top:32px;font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.15em;color:var(--mauve);text-transform:uppercase}
</style>
